n Alexandria and at the Avni Institute, among others with Yitzhak Frenkel, Mokadi, Yanko, Stematsky, Streichman, Hanna Taversky and more. In 1967, Bronfman Publishing released her illustration book: ''Drawings - Animal Figures''. The book includes 24 illustrations of animals that she saw and drew with virtuosity at the Tel Aviv Zoo (where the city garden is located today).</p><p>Malka Ventik was my grandfather''s sister. She had no children of her own and I had no other grandparents, so in practice she was my grandmother.</p><p>To mark 50 years since the publication of her book, I selected several drawings from it and turned them into metal sculptures with laser cutting, while trying to preserve as much as possible the delicate and clean line of the illustrations.</p><p>The sculptures come in a version of a small sculpture for the shelf and two larger sizes for wall hanging. They breathe life into the beautiful illustrations that were almost forgotten and turn them into a contemporary, aesthetic and special element.</p><p>Hope you''ll love them,</p><p>Uri Niv - Founder and owner of the Artauri Design brand</p>','WA112',0.00,NULL,ARRAY['assets/product-1773749769276-dae2j.webp','assets/product-1773749769959-u20ex.webp','assets/product-1773749771033-971x7.webp','assets/product-1773749772052-wlk8yj.webp','assets/product-1773749772632-m87vrd.webp','assets/product-1773749773065-m004vw.webp','assets/product-1773749773681-sjjfrr.webp','assets/product-1773749774082-c9lng.webp','assets/product-1773749774504-jrs5sc.webp','assets/product-1773749774858-gwd6.webp','assets/product-1773749775672-jznssd.webp','assets/product-1773749775961-tvpk9i.webp']::text[],'in_stock',true,0),
