on book: ''Drawings - Animal Figures''. The book includes 24 illustrations of animals that she saw and sketched with virtuosity at the Tel Aviv Zoo (where the City Garden is located today).</p><p>Malka Ventik was my grandfather''s sister. She had no children of her own and I had no other grandparents, so she was essentially my grandmother.</p><p>To mark 50 years since the publication of her book, I selected several drawings from it and turned them into laser-cut metal sculptures, while trying to preserve as much as possible the delicate and clean line of the illustrations.</p><p>The sculptures come in a small shelf sculpture version and two larger sizes for wall hanging. They breathe life into the beautiful illustrations that were almost forgotten and turn them into a contemporary, aesthetic and special element.</p><p>Hope you''ll love them,</p><p>Uri Niv - Founder and owner of the Artauri Design brand</p>',NULL,0.00,NULL,ARRAY['assets/product-1773749769276-5lgc38c.webp','assets/product-1773749770478-9oretc.webp','assets/product-1773749771401-1s0zk9.webp','assets/product-1773749771842-f3n35f.webp','assets/product-1773749772448-isj7y.webp','assets/product-1773749772988-ish0so.webp','assets/product-1773749773390-umtsng.webp','assets/product-1773749773849-uzaeuk.webp','assets/product-1773749774270-v42yzf.webp','assets/product-1773749774650-mat39p.webp']::text[],'in_stock',true,0),
