llustration book: ''Drawings - Animal Figures''. The book includes 24 illustrations of animals that she saw and sketched with virtuosity at the Tel Aviv Zoo (where the city garden is located today).</p><p>Malka Ventic was my grandfather''s sister. She had no children of her own and I had no other grandparents, so she was essentially my grandmother.</p><p>To mark 50 years since the publication of her book, I selected several drawings from it and turned them into laser-cut metal sculptures, while trying to preserve as much as possible the delicate and clean line of the illustrations.</p><p>The sculptures come in a small shelf sculpture version and two larger sizes for wall hanging. They breathe life into the beautiful illustrations that were almost forgotten and turn them into a contemporary, aesthetic and special element.</p><p>Hope you''ll love them,</p><p>Uri Niv - Founder and owner of the Artauri Design brand</p>',NULL,0.00,NULL,ARRAY['assets/product-1773749759336-35si9y.webp','assets/product-1773749760173-llbr315.webp','assets/product-1773749760888-sox4dn.webp','assets/product-1773749761564-6vndzp.webp','assets/product-1773749762932-eto1o5u.webp','assets/product-1773749764026-sg0jmd.webp','assets/product-1773749764959-mt9xj.webp','assets/product-1773749765440-izmi7x.webp','assets/product-1773749765773-js3esn.webp','assets/product-1773749767692-b4aza.webp']::text[],'in_stock',true,0),
