 - Animal Figures''. The book includes 24 illustrations of animals that she saw and sketched with virtuosity at the Tel Aviv Zoo (where the city garden is located today).</p><p>Malka Ventik was my grandfather''s sister. She had no children of her own and I had no other grandparents, so she was essentially my grandmother.</p><p>To mark 50 years since the publication of her book, I selected several drawings from it and turned them into laser-cut metal sculptures, while trying to preserve as much as possible the delicate and clean line of the illustrations.</p><p>The sculptures come in a small shelf sculpture version and two larger sizes for wall hanging. They breathe life into the beautiful illustrations that were almost forgotten and turn them into a contemporary, aesthetic and special element.</p><p>Hope you''ll love them,</p><p>Uri Niv - Founder and owner of the Artauri Design brand</p>',NULL,0.00,NULL,ARRAY['assets/product-1773749758997-exzy08.webp','assets/product-1773749760241-el1grg.webp','assets/product-1773749761042-0w6yht.webp','assets/product-1773749761755-mwlyyo.webp','assets/product-1773749762646-9pqyuc.webp','assets/product-1773749763343-cei5of.webp','assets/product-1773749763652-rrpd7a.webp','assets/product-1773749764169-sjhmji.webp','assets/product-1773749764651-8x9em6.webp','assets/product-1773749765080-dzln6d.webp','assets/product-1773749765763-79o00d.webp','assets/product-1773749766646-dr6ddu.webp']::text[],'in_stock',true,0),
